WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.731
You can remove this thing.

00:00:05.515 --> 00:00:08.296
I’m sorry.
It all seems a bit too mysterious.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.871
Guido! So, listen,
you can sit on the…

00:00:14.871 --> 00:00:18.000
So, Shri Mataji,
the idea is the following:

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.800
is that I would perhaps
just introduce a little bit the thing,

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:29.520
and then I would ask You the question
of the theme of the relationship

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:33.040
of motherhood and spirituality.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:36.800
Because this is to feed an emission
of about twenty minutes

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.520
that we are paying ourselves,
which would be on the channels.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:46.720
After that Alessandra, as asked,
she will just tune in at some point

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:57.840
to ask some questions on education
and children towards the end, at the end.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:02.872
We would like to ask You some questions
on education of children in India.

00:01:02.872 --> 00:01:04.319
I am sorry, did I do?

00:01:04.319 --> 00:01:07.490
Sorry Shri Mataji,
you are sitting on… Sorry.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:08.800
Is the door closed?

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.840
Is the door closed over there?

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:19.840
It’s rather cold. Put the heater.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:25.840
Somebody has to help Danya a little bit
to bring her things down.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:39.840
You do this.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:51.040
Well, it’s interesting
to have the opportunity

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:59.920
to talk about something
so extraordinary as Sahaja Yoga.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.400
The matter of fact
which fascinated me from the very beginning,

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:08.880
is that in Sahaja Yoga there is nothing
which has to be accepted

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:15.120
which is not based
on reality of experience.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:24.800
And everybody knows that all the inner ways
to reality have been explored

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:25.680
by various traditions.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:29.520
For instance in the Tao
one speaks about Yin and Yang,

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:38.320
that is one has to discover within oneself
a dimension which is complementary

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:40.080
to the one in which we live.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.840
And being a man
I always have been wondering

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:51.520
what it would be like to discover
the feminine part of myself

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.720
in a spiritual sense.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:03:00.880
And Sahaja Yoga is, in a very unexpected
and in a very beautiful way,

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:06.160
providing the answer
to this kind of enquiry.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:11.120
It is indeed very important
in the teaching

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:20.640
of Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi
to confirm that we are containing

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:27.840
within ourselves the Yin and the Yang,
that is the male and the feminine aspect.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:33.040
Moreover, Shri Mataji, in Her teaching,
precises that the feminine qualities

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:37.440
are very important for our own ascent.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:46.320
And Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi
being Herself a Woman, a Mother,

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:55.680
a Grand Mother, She has been a Housewife,
She has been knowing all the aspects

00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:02.480
of a woman’s concrete life
that no one is better qualified than Her

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:07.680
to bring to our attention
what is this relationship

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:12.480
which is so mysterious in some way
between the femineity

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:15.600
and spiritual ascent.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:24.880
So perhaps, by a way of introduction,
I should say that the link

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:32.720
between femineity and spiritual ascent
has to be found in motherhood.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:51.520
And, Shri Mataji, may I right away ask you
what is the meaning of Motherhood

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.960
in the spiritual ascent
of a normal human being like me?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.880
It’s absolutely Primordial.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:11.840
It comes from the Primordial being
that we are all created

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:15.920
out of the power of God Almighty.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:23.840
As we say there is the God Almighty
and there is His beloved Son

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.280
and the third one,
we call it as Holy Ghost.

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:32.400
Now, nobody knows anything
about the Holy Ghost,

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:41.680
that it is the Primordial Mother
who is the power of God.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:55.280
Well, but the Primordial Mother
is the power of God.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:06:04.160
God is perhaps very near, as the saints say,
though for most of us,

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.840
He seems sometimes to be very far.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:11.280
So how do we discover
this Primordial Mother

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:13.440
as a personal reality?

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:16.720
It’s a question which I ask
a bit in a hypocritical way,

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.840
because I know the answer of that.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:28.000
Within us, in our being,
the God Almighty is represented

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:33.920
in our heart as the Spirit,

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:40.720
and within us is the Primordial Mother,
the Holy Ghost represented as Kundalini.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:50.960
When the meeting, or the Yoga,
or the union between the two actualizes –

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.360
it has to happen, it’s a happening –

00:06:53.360 --> 00:07:00.560
When it actualizes,
then only you can get the experience

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:07.920
of the Divine force of the Divinity
which is surrounding us.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:17.120
And thus you move one step forward
towards God, understanding Him.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:22.240
And I should perhaps say here that,
in this experience,

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:30.960
Shri Mataji plays a very unique role.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:37.547
She says so often that Sahaja Yoga
is not seeing anything,

00:07:37.547 --> 00:07:43.840
is not having visions, is not understanding:
Sahaja Yoga is becoming.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:51.520
Becoming ourselves actually.
But everybody knows that in the brain.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:59.520
How that becoming really takes place
for me was without any doubt.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:04.240
The result of my first encounter
with Shri Mataji.

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:07.680
It was perhaps
the first encounter of the third kind.

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:19.040
And, Shri Mataji, how is it
that just smiling at somebody

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:26.320
you have the power
to awaken their Kundalini?

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:32.400
You have this kind of catalytical faculty
to give them the key to themselves.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:40.080
It’s nothing very great or fantastic,
as you see every day these things happening.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:47.760
If you place a seed in the Mother Earth,
it sprouts without any effort.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:53.840
The Mother Earth has got the quality,
the nature of Mother Earth is such

00:08:54.720 --> 00:09:01.440
that she can spontaneously awaken
any seed into life.

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.600
I have that quality within myself.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:09.120
Naturally, nothing great,
I have it, that’s all.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:14.240
I have not achieved it. It’s there.
So, I don’t think it’s something fantastic.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:21.840
But the first question you asked that,
when you understand by your brain,

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:26.560
then how is it
you get it as an experience?

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:33.360
By brain whatever you understand,
you understand through your limited mind.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:38.160
Which is beyond you. It’s not within.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:42.240
But when the experience takes place,
you really evolve

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:47.280
and your central nervous system
gets a new dimension

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:54.560
and you get a new consciousness,
new awareness.

00:09:55.440 --> 00:10:01.200
Which is called as Bodha.
Or in Sanskrit it’s called as ‘Vida’.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:07.440
From there the word Veda has come,
and from Bodha Buddha has come.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:16.720
The one who has got the Bodha
means the feeling of the universal power

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:23.120
of God on your central nervous system
is the Bodha.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:27.840
It’s not what you understand
through your brain, through your reading,

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:32.160
through your discussions,
but it’s a built-in process

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:33.680
on your nervous system.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:40.880
And then again, Shri Mataji wants
that this Mother within us

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:48.480
which is this energy of Kundalini,
when She gives us our second birth –

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.400
because one can be born
only from the mother –

00:10:52.160 --> 00:11:01.680
She does it because
She feels the great Mother in you –

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:08.880
“La Grande Madre” –
and then we also develop these qualities

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:20.160
which are the quality of motherhood,
of compassion, of patience, of gentleness.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:28.560
And is it possible, Shri Mataji,
that through this process

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:32.560
one can envisage a transformation
of the behavior

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:37.920
of great number of people?
So that society benefits from all this.

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:41.920
So that is not only an individual process.
Is this possible?

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:46.080
Of course. Because it is
the epitome of your evolution,

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:49.360
it is the evolution
of all the human beings.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:56.000
And those who want to seek it
can have a higher state of awareness

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.800
in which you get complete integrated.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:03.600
Where the motherhood, the fatherhood
and the childhood,

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.760
all these three, combine.

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:12.960
So, as the child you become innocent,
as the mother you become compassionate,

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.840
and as the father you witness.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:20.720
That’s how all these three qualities
just combine in you,

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:24.880
and you become a different person
where you start feeling

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:28.480
that you are the part
and parcel of the whole.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:33.200
And when it happens
it is not a feeling of your mind,

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.480
but is the feeling
on your central nervous system.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.840
So that you can feel others
on your fingertips.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:50.960
So, in other words this Holy Trinity
which was, I should say,

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:57.120
rather difficult to understand
of a Father, a Son and a Holy Spirit,

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:59.520
now it’s getting more precise:
the mother.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:04.160
These they correspond to state
of consciousness within ourselves.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:13.200
But how do we develop then the quality
which Christ said we should have

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:16.720
the quality of the child
so that we can recognize

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:17.600
the mother and the father?

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.960
It is existing within you.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:25.600
The child quality –
the innocence is existing within you.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.080
Only some clouds have come over it.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:32.240
Which are all thrown aside,
and you become the child.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:36.640
When a person has not seen the mother,
he feels lost

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:42.080
and he thinks that he is not protected,
he has nobody to look after,

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.440
he weeps and cries.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:49.280
When he sees the mother, he recognizes:
“Oh, he has the mother”.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:56.240
Actually, are spontaneous.

00:13:56.240 --> 00:14:01.520
And when we look around us
it’s really the one quality that is missing.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:07.040
Everybody play games, I mean, everybody –
many people, many people are fake,

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:12.240
this capacity of just being like children
we have lost it.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:16.960
I have visited, Shri Mataji,
countries in the East,

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:21.520
I was in Nepal as you know,
I was in India and people were so direct,

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:26.560
so one with what they felt in the heart,
what they felt in the brain,

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:27.680
and the way they behave.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:33.200
So, is it possible through Sahaja Yoga
to regain spontaneity?

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.160
And what is this spontaneity
that we are really missing in the west?

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:39.360
Spontaneity comes through innocence.

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:43.120
And innocence is a quality
all the time within us.

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:47.760
Only thing that there are some clouds
which are covering it,

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.920
and are not manifesting
the innocence within us.

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:56.800
But when the Kundalini rises,
She wipes out all those clouds

00:14:56.800 --> 00:15:01.360
and all those hurdles,
and we find the light of innocence

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:03.920
coming through spontaneously.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:16.000
I wish that we could have the quality
to recognize these qualities

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:16.640
when they appear.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:23.680
Because it is a fact
that what you have given

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:29.360
in the field of spirituality
since you started in 1970

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:34.320
is going far beyond
the level of knowledge

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.880
reached even by the Holiest scriptures.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.480
There is no comparison
between what you teach

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:44.640
and what a lot of masters teach,

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:50.000
because what You teach is verifiable
in our central nervous system.

00:15:50.800 --> 00:16:02.160
And then, how it is that people have
such difficulty to recognize the novelty,

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:06.160
the genuineness but also
the tremendous importance

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.240
of your message?

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:15.520
Is it that it is too simple
to be understood?

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:16.560
No, that’s not the point.

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:20.960
The point is that these are the days
of complex advertising,

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:24.560
and we have no advertising like that.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:29.120
It’s a very forthright
understanding of reality.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:36.960
And it is too simple,
by which people have lost their way

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:38.880
and they cannot see something straight.

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:47.360
But they will come round.
Because you suffer.

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:50.720
When you go in the wrong direction,
you always suffer

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:52.320
and you come back to the right point.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:58.080
What should one give
to get one’s realization?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:07.520
Should one pay money?
Should one register in a school?

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:09.280
How does it happen?

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:12.960
Oh, it is innate within you,
just like as I said the seed.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.920
How much do we pay to the Mother Earth?

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:18.160
You don’t have to pay,
you don’t have to do anything,

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.720
just you have to take it
from the Mother Earth,

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:28.720
that she gives you the nourishment
and your Kundalini rises.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:35.760
Is there any reason why it should
take place now and not before?

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:40.880
Because you say it is like seeds
put in the Earth which grows,

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:44.000
and this has taken place
since centuries.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:48.720
But this which I have been witnessing
since now a couple of years,

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:52.160
that is really thousands of people
getting their Self-realization.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:55.680
Now this has not taken place before,
so why should it take place now?

00:17:55.680 --> 00:18:00.000
Because in the evolutionary process,
this is the time.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:05.760
When you reach the state of the flower,
then only we call it a blossom time.

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:08.400
Maybe in the beginning
there are one or two flowers.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:13.840
But you reach a point where there are many,
and then you get so many fruits.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:17.200
It matures at that time.

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:25.840
And, Shri Mataji, please can you tell us
how or why it is that in Italy

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:31.760
there has been such a good response
compared to other European countries?

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:39.520
I went to programs in Milano, in Rome
where people who never heard

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:42.320
about Kundalini,
never heard about these things,

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.760
people who had been warned
against all the fake gurus

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.600
came to you, kissed your hands,
gave you flowers,

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:55.120
were looking absolutely enchanted
and shining, speaking:

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.560
“Oh, la Grande Madre è venuta”.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:03.520
How is it, what makes this country
receptive to this message, Shri Mataji?

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:09.760
I can only say that Italians are the most
sensitive people in the whole of Europe.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:12.080
They are very sensitive;
because they are very human.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:20.720
Others in the grab they are, I think,
are very much grabbed by machineries

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:21.760
and other things,

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:31.040
maybe the climate I think of Italy
is such that people feel balanced.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:36.720
I cannot explain why,
but only I can state as a matter of fact

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:39.120
that they are the most sensitive people.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:43.520
Shri Mataji, I would like to ask you.

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:49.120
We have seen so many so-called gurus
in the west which are used

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:54.560
to collect Rolls-Royces,
and mesmerize people, and like parasites.

00:19:55.600 --> 00:20:02.000
So how it is that you don’t take
any money for your great job?

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:10.080
And another question:
finally we listen talk about the Spirit.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.600
Would you like to say something
about the nature of the Spirit?

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:17.200
Alright. The first question
I have already answered:

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.080
how can you pay?
I mean, how much will you pay?

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:26.400
It is love. It is love of God.
It’s pure love. It just works by itself.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:32.400
I don’t know much about money,
I don’t understand.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.000
This cannot be paid for.
It’s something different.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.120
This is not in the market.

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:42.240
Now, about the fake gurus,
I have been telling about them from 1970

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:44.080
from everywhere that be careful.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:48.240
Because I know
there are so many seekers are born.

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:51.680
In seeking they go to drugs,
in seeking they go to alcohol,

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:53.760
in seeking they go to wrong things.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:59.840
And then they go to fake gurus also.
Because they do not know anything else.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.480
But there is the truth.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:07.360
Now about the Spirit,
it’s a very long subject.

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:13.600
I can only say that the nature of Spirit
is that it is the Truth,

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:18.400
it is the reality, it is the attention.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:24.080
When it comes in the attention,
your attention itself becomes powerful.

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:26.880
And in look at anyone
you can raise the Kundalini

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:27.680
of that person.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:31.200
And thirdly, it is the Joy.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:40.560
Joy is a quality which is absolute,
it is not happiness and unhappiness.

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:44.160
Because these two depend
on ego and super-ego.

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:54.320
But joy is an absolute quality
and that comes only from the Spirit.

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:03.600
Are the conditions that a man,
a normal man living in the world of today,

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:07.040
with the worries that we all have,
the stress of the work,

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:13.920
the problems of the family,
is there any special type of person

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:18.880
which can get this?
Or can anybody get it?

00:22:18.880 --> 00:22:22.720
I mean, what makes the difference
between those who get it

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:24.000
and those who don’t?

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.640
There are a special categories also.
They are called as seekers.

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:30.720
The people who are seeking beyond.

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:36.400
They think that they haven’t yet got
what they wanted from life.

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:39.600
They are not seeking money,
they are not seeking positions,

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:41.840
but what they are seeking
they do not know.

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:46.640
Such people are a special category,
and they get realization

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:48.400
without any difficulties.

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:51.280
But once we have many people realized,
why not.

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:55.920
The whole world should get it.
Because that is what they are here for.

00:22:58.160 --> 00:23:06.560
Well, saint John said in the Apocalypse
that the elected would be 144.000.

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:11.120
I always found this word “elected”
very disagreeable,

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:13.760
because it sounded a bit elitist,

00:23:13.760 --> 00:23:18.960
but I was very happy to know
that you felt that John was a bit miserly

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:22.240
and that there should be many more people
to get their realization.

00:23:22.240 --> 00:23:24.960
You see, what he said were elected.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:28.880
But elected doesn’t mean
electorates are less.

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:32.400
The ones who elect are many,
but the elected means

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:35.840
the one who will do the job.

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:43.120
Shri Mataji, to get many people,
it is very important

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:50.880
to provide them some guidance,

00:23:50.880 --> 00:23:54.800
because I found,
having children in school,

00:23:54.800 --> 00:24:02.400
that our children are often left
to very destructive influences,

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:04.880
everybody know
we have drugs in the school,

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:06.480
we have all kind of behavior.

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:12.720
And it seems that we should also
speak about children

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:16.440
because there is this family
of the Father, of the Mother

00:24:16.440 --> 00:24:17.920
and of the Child.

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:24.560
And what about the children, Shri Mataji,
how can we give the right guidance

00:24:24.560 --> 00:24:28.560
to our children so that they can develop
in themselves from the young age

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:34.320
this readiness to open
towards their deeper self?

00:24:35.520 --> 00:24:37.920
Most of the children
who will be born to you,

00:24:37.920 --> 00:24:41.760
those who have got realization,
will be all realized souls.

00:24:42.480 --> 00:24:48.640
Also, there are
tremendous flow of divinity

00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:55.520
in that realm, in that area,
and I find there are lots of saints

00:24:55.520 --> 00:25:00.240
being born these days.
And these are going to come as your children.

00:25:00.880 --> 00:25:06.000
But it is important that the parents
must understand the deeper significance

00:25:06.000 --> 00:25:16.560
of the Spirit, and the effect
of the bad things on the children,

00:25:17.840 --> 00:25:22.720
and they are the best
to keep them out of any dangers.

00:25:23.280 --> 00:25:28.160
But as these children are realized souls,
I am sure they will get out

00:25:28.160 --> 00:25:29.760
of most of those influences.

00:25:29.760 --> 00:25:33.840
On the contrary when they will grow,
they will change all these things

00:25:33.840 --> 00:25:35.360
with greater dynamism.

00:25:36.400 --> 00:25:39.280
Do you think this will change
also our society

00:25:39.280 --> 00:25:42.800
through this different kind of people
that will come out?

00:25:43.680 --> 00:25:46.960
People make the society.
When the people change,

00:25:46.960 --> 00:25:48.240
the society will change.

00:25:49.120 --> 00:25:54.480
And the society always bows
to something that is noble. Always.

00:25:55.120 --> 00:25:55.840
In the long run.

00:25:56.480 --> 00:26:04.000
Have you ever seen a statue erected
of a man who has been running after women

00:26:04.000 --> 00:26:05.280
or who has been drinking?

00:26:06.080 --> 00:26:09.840
Society does not respect
anything that is not respectable.

00:26:10.400 --> 00:26:12.400
All these waves come and go away.

00:26:13.760 --> 00:26:18.240
Only the nobility, the righteousness,
the higher qualities are respected.

00:26:19.280 --> 00:26:23.760
For a short time, it works out.
So, the society has to change.

00:26:23.760 --> 00:26:28.240
Because it will see the noble work
God is doing through you people,

00:26:28.800 --> 00:26:31.360
and the society will definitely change.
It has to change.

00:26:32.560 --> 00:26:36.720
We say that the whole world
can bow to you,

00:26:36.720 --> 00:26:40.320
but there should be the One who knows
how to make them bow to you.

00:26:40.320 --> 00:26:43.120
Nowadays they are bowing
to something unreal.

00:26:44.320 --> 00:26:47.440
But after all they are human beings.

00:26:48.560 --> 00:26:54.240
They are the highest
in the realm of God’s creation

00:26:54.960 --> 00:26:58.080
and they will definitely realize
that reality is reality.

00:26:59.680 --> 00:27:04.160
How should their parents behave
to grow them up in such a way

00:27:04.160 --> 00:27:06.240
that they can keep the qualities,
let’s say?

00:27:07.600 --> 00:27:13.200
In this western country, the children
have the biggest problem of ego.

00:27:14.800 --> 00:27:19.840
If the parents are egoistical,
then the child also become egoistical.

00:27:20.560 --> 00:27:26.240
If the mother is a hectic woman,
and she is all the time

00:27:26.240 --> 00:27:29.520
running up and down,
the child might develop a disease

00:27:29.520 --> 00:27:30.320
called Leukaemia.

00:27:32.080 --> 00:27:35.680
All kinds of problems can arise
from the disturbed parents.

00:27:36.400 --> 00:27:43.040
The first and foremost thing –
the adults must decide that if they have

00:27:43.040 --> 00:27:48.000
to marry and have children,
they have to be responsible for them

00:27:48.000 --> 00:27:53.360
and they have to behave themselves
in such a manner that the children

00:27:53.360 --> 00:27:57.120
do not get any repercussion from them.

00:27:58.080 --> 00:28:02.480
And Shri Mataji, one other aspect,
very important for the growth

00:28:02.480 --> 00:28:07.600
of the children is the school,
because they spend a lot of time

00:28:07.600 --> 00:28:12.640
in school.
And what are your suggestions about school?

00:28:13.680 --> 00:28:17.280
The school should be such
that children should be told

00:28:17.280 --> 00:28:23.920
about the higher life and the nobler life
and the children must be trained

00:28:23.920 --> 00:28:27.600
and disciplined for it.
Nowadays it has stopped.

00:28:27.600 --> 00:28:31.760
People do not talk of God;
they do not want to talk of Spirit.

00:28:31.760 --> 00:28:35.520
Because there has been
lots of artificiality in the name of God.

00:28:35.520 --> 00:28:40.400
But when you know it is the reality,
it is better to tell them openly

00:28:40.400 --> 00:28:43.920
that there is God.
And you have to experience Him.

00:28:43.920 --> 00:28:50.160
That’s all is the stage left.
So, the children will also feel confident.

00:28:50.160 --> 00:28:56.560
Normally children are aware of God
and they want to talk about God,

00:28:56.560 --> 00:28:57.920
they like it.

00:28:57.920 --> 00:29:03.200
But it’s the parents by their behavior
just take away their attention from that.

00:29:04.000 --> 00:29:08.080
Is this the secret of the joy
that we see in Indian children,

00:29:09.280 --> 00:29:12.640
we see such sparkling eyes
compared to ours.

00:29:13.240 --> 00:29:14.720
Definitely, I think…

